title: 'cumulus: add resubmittable-segment hydration API'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |
    Adds an internal helper to the slot-based collator that rebuilds a V3 resubmittable segment —
    a core's resubmittable parachain blocks, oldest first — back into collation parts from local
    state only: the parachain backend, the code-hash provider and the resubmission store. The
    headers are regrouped into their original bundles and each bundle's stored proofs are merged
    into one PoV. Nothing calls it yet; the resubmission wiring that follows does.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: minor
